```Account timeline: normalized JSON only; set time picker to include 2026-10-08 UTC.```
index=lateral_lab
| spath
| where account="LAB\\svc-backup"
| sort 0 timestamp
| table timestamp event_uid host channel event_id logon_type source_host logon_id image parent_image

```Service-account RemoteInteractive candidate. Replace the example account with an inventory lookup in production.```
index=lateral_lab
| spath
| where channel="Security" AND event_id=4624 AND logon_type=10 AND account="LAB\\svc-backup"
| table timestamp event_uid account source_host source_ip host logon_id

```Supporting service installations; does not attribute the operator.```
index=lateral_lab
| spath
| where channel="System" AND event_id=7045 AND lower(service_name)="psexesvc"
| table timestamp event_uid host service_name image service_account

```Supporting child-process evidence. Run separately from the above searches.```
index=lateral_lab
| spath
| where ((channel="Security" AND event_id=4688) OR (channel="Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" AND event_id=1)) AND like(lower(parent_image), "%psexesvc.exe")
| table timestamp event_uid host account image parent_image process_guid
